-- title:
--   A surviving coordinate has a shortened-tuple preimage
-- statement:
--   For a type $G$, coordinates $i,t\in\mathrm{Fin}(n)$ with $t\ne i$, and tuple $y$, there exists $q\in\mathrm{Fin}(n-1)$ such that erasing coordinate $i$ leaves value $y_t$ at $q$, and the numerical reinsertion index of $q$ is $t$. The formal conclusion asserts existence.
